[N 40-41 Riverglades]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Back in the Riverglades at 40: Bolder'ok and Dunston's escape, the Twilight's Shroud with Sergeant Riftan, the chapel's water trouble, and Ghostmaw if you have the help. Ends at Farholde Keep, ready for Powderfuse Port.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 40|r  -  this chapter wants level 40: Riftan's and Dunston's quests need 38 but are level 42-44, the Shroud's Corrupters are 42 and its Champions 44, the Bolder'ok ogres 41 with Chub'chob (45 elite) and Clugfist (50 elite) beside Gronok. Under 40, finish the level-40 block first
[OC]|cffffffffFarholde Keep|r  -  you arrive by hearth from Uldaman (chapter 39e); hearth = Farholde Keep and it stays there. A short clean-up: 15 plain quests, about 33,820 quest XP and 30s, every kill target a normal mob (the elites are named below: keep clear). Mounted if you bought the ram in chapter 39d; every leg works on foot. Mail counts from here: the Verger Greaves from chapter 38 go on now
[OC]|cffffcc00Sources:|r as in chapter 38, givers and hand-ins come from the DB, and the points it lacks come from Wowhead's maps. Chain orders follow the prerequisites QuestieDB 1.1.1 takes from player traces (Brother Lowley and Sister Rowland hand out their chain one quest at a time)
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r The Riverglades Report (95315, from Captain Nials in chapter 39) and Saving Marshal Ryan (94887) only if the Field Marshal's Log dropped in chapter 38. A Few Furs for Friz (94928), if you hold it, rides on to chapter 41. Bring 20 Mageweave Cloth for Brother Lowley (chapter 38's note; topped up at the Ironforge Auction House in chapter 39d)
[OC]|cffffcc00Training:|r none here; you trained the level-40 ranks in chapter 39d

